# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MoveX Digital — Multi-Device Workspace .gitignore
# Strategy:
#   - GitHub syncs: Code, HTML/CSS/JS, lightweight web images, GEMINI.md,
#     .antigravity/rules.md, .antigravity/skills/, and scripts/
#   - Google Drive syncs: Heavy raw design/video assets (*.psd, *.ai, *.mp4, *.mov, *.zip)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 1. OS & Editor Junk Files (Prevents Google Drive + Git file-lock conflicts)
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
~$*
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo

# 2. Dependencies & Build Artifacts
node_modules/
.pnp/
.pnp.js
dist/
build/
.cache/
.vercel/
.netlify/
.wrangler/

# 3. Environment & Local Secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

# 4. Heavy Raw Design, Video & Archive Files (Handled by Google Drive, NOT GitHub)
*.psd
*.psb
*.ai
*.eps
*.indd
*.fig
*.sketch
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wav
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar.gz
*.exe
*.dmg
*.pkg

# 5. Explicitly Track Core AI Memory, Rules & Skills
!GEMINI.md
!.antigravity/
!.antigravity/rules.md
!.antigravity/skills/
!.antigravity/skills/*.md
!scripts/
!scripts/sync-all.ps1
!scripts/sync-all.sh
